Description:
## Goal
Implement Ktorfit service interface for Fineract loan APIs.

## File
libs/mifos-loans/src/commonMain/kotlin/org/mifospay/loans/network/LoansService.kt

## Endpoints
```kotlin
interface LoansService {
    @GET("/self/loanproducts")
    fun getLoanProducts(): Flow<List<LoanProductEntity>>

    @GET("/self/loans/{loanId}")
    fun getLoanDetails(@Path loanId: Long): Flow<LoanDetailsEntity>

    @GET("/self/loans/{loanId}/repaymentSchedule")
    fun getRepaymentSchedule(@Path loanId: Long): Flow<LoanScheduleEntity>

    @POST("/self/loans")
    suspend fun applyForLoan(@Body application: LoanApplicationEntity): LoanApplicationResponse

    @POST("/self/loans/{loanId}/transactions")
    suspend fun makePayment(@Path loanId: Long, @Body payment: LoanPaymentEntity)
}
```

## Pattern
Follow core/network/services patterns

## Goal
Implement repository layer with DataState pattern.

## Files
1. LoansRepository.kt (interface)
2. LoansRepositoryImpl.kt (implementation)

## Pattern
```kotlin
class LoansRepositoryImpl(
    private val loansService: LoansService,
    private val ioDispatcher: CoroutineDispatcher
) : LoansRepository {
    override fun getLoanProducts(): Flow<DataState<List<LoanProduct>>> {
        return loansService.getLoanProducts()
            .map { entities -> entities.map { it.toModel() } }
            .asDataStateFlow()
            .flowOn(ioDispatcher)
    }
}
```

## Reference
core/data/repositoryImpl/SavingsAccountRepositoryImpl.kt

## Goal
Create Koin dependency injection module.

## File
libs/mifos-loans/src/commonMain/kotlin/org/mifospay/loans/di/LoansModule.kt

## Implementation
```kotlin
val LoansModule = module {
    // API Service
    single { get<KtorfitClient>().create(LoansService::class) }

    // Repository
    single<LoansRepository> {
        LoansRepositoryImpl(get(), get(named("ioDispatcher")))
    }

    // ViewModels
    viewModelOf(::LoanProductsViewModel)
    viewModelOf(::LoanDetailsViewModel)
    viewModelOf(::LoanApplicationViewModel)
}
```

